The '''Primordial Hatchling''' is a [[Mob]] that can spawn when fighting a {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}}.

== Spawning ==
During the {{SlayerTier|V}} {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} fight, it will use its '''Web of Lies''' ability at {{Red|66%}} and {{Red|33%}} {{Stat|Health}}. This will cause it to spawn 4 eggs sacs above it, each with {{Hp|6}}. If the eggs aren't shot down in time, they will hatch into '''Primordial Minions'''.

== Behavior ==
'''Primordial Minions''' run towards the player to attack them.

